,"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, August to September landed at 34% of normal on the middle and September to October at 42%. Grid 25083 had its driest year in 1963, at 65% of normal.</p>"}
